{"id":"22.11.HomeDesign","contentHtml":"<h3><strong>Home Design (Playgendary)</strong> | Lead Unity Developer / Technical Owner</h3>\n<p>My path on the <em>Home Design</em> project was illustrative. Starting as a Unity Developer and proving myself on other company tasks, I received an offer to return to the project in a new role.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Management entrusted me with the position of a de facto <code>Technical Owner</code></strong> to relaunch the active development phase. I took full responsibility for the technical quality of the product.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key challenge was <strong>leadership on a large-scale Live-Ops project</strong>. I had to take over a complex codebase, <strong>form a new development team</strong>, and build a predictable feature delivery pipeline. It was required to dive into Enterprise-level architecture in a short time and ensure the uninterrupted release of updates.</p>\n<h2>My Role &#x26; Solutions</h2>\n<p>I acted as the bridge between business and technology:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Architectural Control:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Conducted <strong>deep analysis (Reverse Engineering)</strong> of the existing codebase. Systematized knowledge about the architecture, becoming the key technical expert on the project.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Team Management:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Formed and led the team.</strong> Established processes: from task decomposition to regular <strong>Code Reviews</strong> and mentorship, improving <strong>Code Quality</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Monetization &#x26; Live-Ops:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Designed the implementation</strong> of critical features: new ad placements and a <strong>premium subscription</strong> system.</li>\n<li>Ensured <strong>release stability</strong>, personally resolving complex architectural bugs and reducing <code>ANR/Crash Rate</code> metrics.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Communication:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Defended technical solutions before business and product managers, ensuring a balance between development speed and technical debt.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Successful Hit Management:</strong> Ensured stable development and support of a major project during its active operation phase.</li>\n<li><strong>Competence Growth:</strong> This case became the <mark>driver of my transition to an Architect role</mark>. I honed my skills in working with legacy code, building processes, and technical leadership.</li>\n<li><strong>Business Impact:</strong> The team's solutions directly improved monetization metrics and application stability.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Home Design","date":"2022-11","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Puzzle","Unity","C#"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>My experience at Playgendary: <mark>acted as <strong>Technical Owner</strong></mark> on the flagship hit <em>Home Design</em>, leading the development and architectural evolution of the project.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://newplg.dev/","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playgendary.homes","https://apps.apple.com/ru/app/design-masters/id1495346254"],"role":"lead","projectIcon":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/card.video?v=1765047169096&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/0.webp","width":500,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/1.webp","width":500,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/2.webp","width":500,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/3.webp","width":500,"height":1080}]}